Subject: [PATCH 1/3] refactor: retire Gemini CLI account preview

Remove the non-executable gemini-cli provider from Core metadata and Desktop OAuth surfaces. Retire legacy persisted entries at the connection-catalog boundary without blocking supported connections, while preserving the ordinary Google API-key provider.

